 468  * Defining variables
 469  Positive Variables
 470  vteste(ipipe)
 471  q_edge(iedge)     volumetric flow rate
 472  k_edge(iedge)     massic flow rate
 473  f_pu(ipump,s)     pump head
 474  f_pi(ipipe,n)     pipe head loss per subsection
 475  f_he(ihe)         heat exchanger head loss
 476  q_circ(icirc)     volumetric flow rate per circuit
 477  lvalve(icirc)     valve head loss
 478  cpipe             annualized capital cost of the pipe sections
 479  cpump             annualized capital cost for the pumping system
 480  cpen              annualized overall penalization due higher outlet temper
      ature of hot fluid
 481  cope              overall operating cost of a pump
 482  cr(ihe)           heat capacity ratio
 483  U(ihe)            overall heat transfer coefficient
 484  h_w(ihe)          convection heat transfer coefficient of water
 485  h_hot(ihe)        convection heat transfer coefficient of hot fluid
 486  NTU(ihe)          number of transfer units
 487  epsilon(ihe)      effectiveness of a counter-current flow heat exchanger
 488  k_he_hot(ihe)     mass flow rate of hot fluid in heat exchanger
 489  T_w_feed          water temperature at cooling tower inlet
 490  T_w_base          water temperature at cooling tower outlet
 491  T_w_in(ihe)       water temperature at heat exchanger inlet
 492  T_w_out(ihe)      water temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 493  T_hot_out(ihe)    hot fluid temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 494  che(ihe)          financial loss
 495  IM                integral of Merkel
